==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
A form of ''[[nokkur]]''

===Adverb===
{{is-adv}}

# [[fairly]], [[quite]]
#: {{ux|is|Þetta er '''nokkuð''' gott.|This is '''rather''' good.}}
